# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Nexus — LOCAL environment (APP_ENV=local)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Flutter Web does not read dotenv files at runtime. Config is compiled in via
# --dart-define at build/run time. This file documents the values you pass.
#
# The idiomatic local workflow uses --dart-define-from-file with a JSON file.
# Copy the committed template to the gitignored real file and fill it in:
#
#   cp dart_define.local.example.json dart_define.local.json
#
# Then run:
#   flutter run -d chrome --dart-define-from-file=dart_define.local.json
#
# Get SUPABASE_URL + SUPABASE_ANON_KEY from `supabase status` after
# `supabase start`. On the current CLI, SUPABASE_ANON_KEY is the "Publishable"
# key (sb_publishable_...). Never commit real keys; only *.example templates
# are committed (dart_define.local.json is gitignored).

APP_ENV=local
SUPABASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:54321
SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-local-anon-key-here
